  "description": "This package provides a simple and efficient way to dynamically load multiple JavaScript files in your Blazor applications using a window.loadScripts function. By passing an array of script URLs, the function ensures each script is loaded sequentially, handles errors gracefully, and supports asynchronous execution to improve performance and flexibility. Perfect for scenarios where on-demand script loading is required.",
